{"id":"bfadcdf3957c7ca3","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-protocol-bad-state-witness.md","title":"协议坏状态的有限反例界","display":"thm-protocol-bad-state-witness — 协议坏状态的有限反例界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-protocol-bad-state-witness","aliases":["73-thm-protocol-bad-state-witness"],"display":"thm-protocol-bad-state-witness — 协议坏状态的有限反例界","depends_on":["[[73-df-partial-protocol-product]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§2.1.5, print pp. 43–44; PDF pp. 65–66; locally proved shortest-path bound","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":2},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-protocol-bad-state-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-protocol-bad-state-witness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-protocol-bad-state-witness — 协议坏状态的有限反例界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e8878df4beac2bd8\" href=\"?note=e8878df4beac2bd8\" title=\"73-df-partial-protocol-product\">73-df-partial-protocol-product</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§2.1.5, print pp. 43–44; PDF pp. 65–66; locally proved shortest-path bound"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e8878df4beac2bd8\" href=\"?note=e8878df4beac2bd8\" title=\"73-df-partial-protocol-product\">73-df-partial-protocol-product</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq Q\">\\(B\\subseteq Q\\)</span> 是坏状态集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=|Q_1||Q_2|\">\\(N=|Q_1||Q_2|\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 是有限状态路径，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 是动作词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Reach}_\\parallel\\cap B\\ne\\varnothing\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;(m&lt;N\\land\\exists q:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to Q\\;\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^m\\;\\bigl[q(0)=s\\land q(m)\\in B\\land\n\\forall h\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;((q(h),w(h)),q(h+1))\\in\\delta_\\parallel\\bigr]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Reach}_\\parallel\\cap B\\ne\\varnothing\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;(m&lt;N\\land\\exists q:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to Q\\;\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^m\\;\\bigl[q(0)=s\\land q(m)\\in B\\land\n\\forall h\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;((q(h),w(h)),q(h+1))\\in\\delta_\\parallel\\bigr]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>最短到坏状态的路径不重复状态，否则可删除循环。因此至多 N−1 条边；初态已坏时 m=0。遍历有限乘积图即可判定安全性，所得短词是具体反例证书。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-partial-protocol-product","status":"resolved","id":"e8878df4beac2bd8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-partial-protocol-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-protocol-product","status":"resolved","id":"e8878df4beac2bd8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[73-df-partial-protocol-product]]；$B\\subseteq Q$ 是坏状态集，$N=|Q_1||Q_2|$。$q$ 是有限状态路径，$w$ 是动作词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"B\\subseteq Q","display":false},{"tex":"N=|Q_1||Q_2|","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Reach}_\\parallel\\cap B\\ne\\varnothing\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;(m<N\\land\\exists q:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to Q\\;\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^m\\;\\bigl[q(0)=s\\land q(m)\\in B\\land\n\\forall h\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;((q(h),w(h)),q(h+1))\\in\\delta_\\parallel\\bigr]).","display":true}],"bytes":1423,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-protocol-bad-state-witness|协议坏状态的有限反例界]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["e8878df4beac2bd8"]}